---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Nicolás Moreale is an AWS engineer in Buenos Aires working on Amazon Connect contact centers, cloud data pipelines and analytics."
>
  <header class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Nicolás, an AWS engineer in Buenos Aires. I build and support Amazon Connect contact centers
      and the data systems around them.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap columns">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Since late 2025 I've worked on Amazon Connect for pharmaceutical patient-support programs: contact
        flows and routing, voicemail, Salesforce Service Cloud Voice, Lambda and DynamoDB integrations,
        and the reporting on top. It's regulated work. A call that lands in the wrong queue or a service
        level that's calculated the wrong way is a real problem, so I test with real calls and write
        everything down.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that I worked on data, reporting and cloud operations at Cognizant, and on process
        automation at IBM. I have a Bachelor's degree in Data Science from the University of the City of
        Buenos Aires, and that's the direction I'm taking this work: contact centers produce a lot of
        data, and most teams use very little of it.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work in English and Spanish, and also speak French, Italian and German. Buenos Aires keeps me on
        US hours, with a few hours of overlap with Europe every morning.
      </p>

      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Small, fixed-scope engagements with a written scope and price up front.</li>
        <li>Access through an IAM role you create and can revoke. No shared passwords.</li>
        <li>Changes tested before they reach production, and documented after.</li>
        <li>No client names in my case studies without permission.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <aside class="facts ui" aria-label="Background">
      <section>
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <dl>
          <div>
            <dt>Syneos Health</dt>
            <dd>AWS and Amazon Connect engineer, 2025 to now</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Cognizant</dt>
            <dd>Data engineer, 2024 to 2025</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>IBM</dt>
            <dd>Automation developer, 2021 to 2022</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Education and credentials</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Bachelor's degree in Data Science, University of the City of Buenos Aires</li>
          <li>Information Systems Engineering, Universidad Tecnológica Nacional</li>
          <li>Machine Learning Specialization, DeepLearning.AI and Stanford Online</li>
          <li>Google Cloud: Building Batch Data Pipelines; Modernizing Data Lakes and Data Warehouses</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></li>
          {site.github && <li><a href={site.github}>GitHub</a></li>}
          <li><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <CallToAction />
</Base>

<style>
  .columns {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem 4rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .columns {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .facts h2 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-stretch: 92%;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .facts dl {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .facts dt {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .facts dd {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .facts ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
</style>
